    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join us on discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The witch blade is a 2d pixel art platformer where you go on a quest to save your girlfriend!<br>Fight enemies with precise combat mechanics discover an intriguing story and confront deadly bosses!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Precise and punitive combats</h2><br>Parry, dodge, and attack with the right timing to stay alive!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000050/extras/114099026274223ccd1b00bd40cf62e6.poster.avif?t=1654363530\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000050/extras/114099026274223ccd1b00bd40cf62e6.webm?t=1654363530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000050/extras/114099026274223ccd1b00bd40cf62e6.mp4?t=1654363530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Compelling story</h2><br>Explore this world of dark fantasy to discover all its secrets.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000050/extras/2e9a0b05fc0b3b529493276605f4c8e8.poster.avif?t=1654363530\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000050/extras/2e9a0b05fc0b3b529493276605f4c8e8.webm?t=1654363530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000050/extras/2e9a0b05fc0b3b529493276605f4c8e8.mp4?t=1654363530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get ready to die</h2><br>This world is tough, so get ready to die if you want to beat this challenging game!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000050/extras/4ff6880060421e10669febf92c3f67c6.poster.avif?t=1654363530\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000050/extras/4ff6880060421e10669febf92c3f67c6.webm?t=1654363530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000050/extras/4ff6880060421e10669febf92c3f67c6.mp4?t=1654363530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
